<title>PHILIPPINES: JG Summit Jan-Mar net up 10.4 pct.</title>
<headline>JG Summit Jan-Mar net up 10.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31</p>
<p>	    (in million pesos unless stated)</p>
<p>    Revenues (billion)	     2.52 vs 2.10</p>
<p>    Net income			721.5 vs 653.4</p>
<p>Note: Full name JG Summit Holdings Inc. The company attributed the growth to its banking, real estate and telecommunications subsidiaries.</p>
<p>-- MANILA NEWSROOM (63 2) 841-8938 Fax 817-6267</p>
